{0}

Hlola kuqala izinkambu zokuchaza futhi uqiniseke ukuthi aziqukethe ulwazi oluyimfihlo.

Lokhu kuzosusa unomphela ukufakwa ku: {0}
Umlando we-add-on wokungenisa kanye namakhophi okubuyisela kule seva agcinwe yi-Synix nawo azosuswa.
Ama-archive okugcina amaseva agcwele agcinwa ngaphandle uma ukhetha inketho engezansi.

