{0}

Amaphasiwedi agciniwe e-Synix nama-webhooks e-Discord angabuyiselwa ku-PC entsha ngaleli phasiwedi lokudlulisa. Gcina nephothifoliyo; ayikwazi ukubuyiselwa.

I-Synix yathunyelwa:

{0}

Leli fayela alibhalisiwe, ngakho ligcine endaweni ethile yangasese. Amaphasiwedi aphethwe yi-Synix nama-webhooks e-Discord kungase kudingeke ukuthi afakwe kabusha kwenye i-PC.

